    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d835-a2">

                <pb facs="0815" n="717" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg717"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">List.</hi></head>
                <p>Mr. Rogers (was the leader to go to Millikens Bend to hang Joseph Delfino and his
                    son), Fred. Lichslider, Edward Stewart, Mr. Coleman (he was the one that climbed
                    the tree and tied the rope), Burt. Severe, Tom Nola, Dave Evans, Jim Johnson,
                    Fred. Johnson (was the one that carried the rope), Scott, Anden Severe
                    (furnished the rope), John Yerger, Jim Ervesie, Jim Stone, Tom Broders, Fred
                    Broders, Sam Slank, Paul Bruse, Billy Bruse.</p>
                <p>A true copy of the original.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. Papini</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting Consul of Italy.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New
                                Orleans</hi></placeName>. <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-01-16"><hi rendition="#italic">January 16,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
